# A lazy fence: the epoch is persisted eagerly but the shard's entry is raised
# only by the activation's first append, so a stale duplicate appends between
# the newer activation's claim and that append, above the claim head the newer
# activation replays to.
MODULE: NoTrimPastAckedLazyFence
TARGET: NoTrimPastAcked
CLASS: Invariant
SUMMARY: the claim does not raise the WAL shard's entry; the activation's first append does
PERTURBS: ClaimWrite, ClaimRaise, OwnAlloc

--- FIND
    /\ fence' = Max2(fence, epoch[a])
    /\ cstage' = [cstage EXCEPT ![a] = 2]
--- REPLACE
\* MUTATION: the claim leaves the durable entry alone.
    /\ fence' = fence
    /\ cstage' = [cstage EXCEPT ![a] = 2]
--- END

--- FIND
    /\ memFence' = epoch[a]
    /\ claimHead' = [claimHead EXCEPT ![a] = next]
--- REPLACE
\* MUTATION: the claim leaves the loaded entry alone.
    /\ memFence' = memFence
    /\ claimHead' = [claimHead EXCEPT ![a] = next]
--- END

--- FIND
    /\ memFence > 0
    /\ epoch[a] >= memFence
    /\ epoch[a] > retired
    /\ next < MaxOff
    /\ next' = next + 1
    /\ author' = [author EXCEPT ![next] = a]
    /\ inflight' = inflight \cup {next}
    /\ staleAccepted' = (staleAccepted \/ epoch[a] < maxClaimed \/ epoch[a] <= retired)
    /\ seenU' = [seenU EXCEPT ![a] = Max2(@, lastU)]
    /\ UNCHANGED <<walkVars, lastU, oldUsed, durable, acked, floor, leafVars, epochVars, handVars, gateVars,
                   viewVars, envVars, oldRejected, wghosts>>
--- REPLACE
    /\ epoch[a] >= memFence
    /\ epoch[a] > retired
    /\ next < MaxOff
    /\ next' = next + 1
    /\ author' = [author EXCEPT ![next] = a]
    /\ inflight' = inflight \cup {next}
    /\ staleAccepted' = (staleAccepted \/ epoch[a] < maxClaimed \/ epoch[a] <= retired)
    /\ seenU' = [seenU EXCEPT ![a] = Max2(@, lastU)]
\* MUTATION: the first append raises the entry instead.
    /\ fence' = Max2(fence, epoch[a])
    /\ memFence' = Max2(memFence, epoch[a])
    /\ UNCHANGED <<walkVars, lastU, oldUsed, durable, acked, floor, leafVars, rowEpoch, seen, epoch, cstage,
                   claimHead, retired, maxClaimed, handVars, gateVars, viewVars, envVars,
                   oldRejected, wghosts>>
--- END
